Subject: Preserve original HBM SoundThread messages on native pointer widths

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Use the live OSMessage carrier width only for the original numeric message
comparisons. Include existing lock/list declarations directly under the native
compiler profile. Retain all original method bodies and console includes.
The shared 0523/0524 compiler headers remain separate prerequisites.

